{"name":"Dedication","hex":"#fee2c8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dedication","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of dedicating or the state of being dedicated.","A note addressed to a patron or friend, prefixed to a work of art as a token of respect, esteem, or affection."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dedication"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dedication (ritual)","blocks":[{"text":"Dedication is a ceremony to mark the official completion or opening of something. Such rituals include ceremonial ship launching and a variety of events for buildings including builders' rites or an opening ceremony. Many religions have specific dedication rituals, which serve to consecrate items, places, or people to sacred purpose, such as the dedication of churches or Child dedication."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dedication_(ritual)"},{"title":"Dedication of churches","blocks":[{"text":"Dedication of churches is a Christian dedication ceremony of a church building. Churches under the authority of a bishop are usually dedicated by that office holder."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Invigning_Storvreta_Kyrka.jpg/330px-Invigning_Storvreta_Kyrka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dedication_of_churches"},{"title":"Dedication (Bay City Rollers album)","blocks":[{"text":"Dedication is an album by the Scottish band Bay City Rollers, released in September 1976. It was the band's fourth original studio album, and the first new album to be released in the wake of their enormous worldwide success of early 1976. Its release was supported by a number of singles, most notably \"Yesterday's Hero\", \"Money Honey\", \"Rock and Roll Love Letter\" and their cover version of the Dusty Springfield song \"I Only Want to Be with You\" which featured only on the North American release."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1a/Bay0.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dedication_(Bay_City_Rollers_album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Biskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg/500px-Biskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Biskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg/1280px-Biskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Biskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg/500px-Biskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABiskop_Karin_Johannesson_inviger_Storvreta_kyrka.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Pr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg/500px-Pr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Pr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg/1280px-Pr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Pr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg/500px-Pr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Latin dedicatory inscription of 1119 for the church of Prüfening Abbey, Germany","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APr%C3%BCfeninger_Weiheinschrift._Pic_01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Notre-Dame_de_la_